  "published": "2026-07-26T18:56:54.293Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds OnUserSlideChange and OnSliderFirstMove, so a slide change the user dragged can be told apart from a code-driven one - by index alone they are identical, and Loop re-announces the slide it left after a programmatic move finishes. Adds SwiperOptions.ResizeObserver and SwiperOptions.A11y (ScrollOnFocus): Swiper's resize and focus handling both end by re-anchoring onto the index they hold, deferred by a frame, which undoes a host move made in the same interaction - set ResizeObserver false when the slides resize as a matter of course. Adds ArmAnchor and UpdateAndAnchor to keep the slider on a known slide when the host framework adds or removes slide elements itself. autoHeight now stays true after init, cssMode navigation animates instead of being cancelled by scroll-snap, and the slider is hidden until it has positioned its first slide.",
